  "text": "PRIVACY & COOKIES MuviDB uses essential cookies to keep you signed in. Optional analytics (PostHog) run only if you accept — under Nigeria’s NDPA 2023. Details in our Privacy Policy. Decline Accept Movies TV Shows Showtimes Stage People More Search films, plays, talent... ⌘ K Sign In FILM Dear Ajayi 2026 1h 56m 15 Movie English 🏆 1 Nomination 1 VIDEO Official Trailer PHOTOS & STILLS Production Media 70% FRESH CRITICS SCORE 1 Reviews Counted 41% AUDIENCE SCORE 8 Ratings Logged 7.6 /10 MUVIDB SCORE Rate CONSENSUS \"Her restriction is not in her bearing but in the world surrounding it: a music industry that demands compromises she was not prepared to make, relationships that begin with promise and reveal themselves as another form of containment, a family that reads her ambition as irresponsibility.\" — Shalom O. Obisesan (NollyCritic) THEATRICAL BOX OFFICE Not Reported Yet Official CEAN theatrical tracking Suggest Box Office Faith Drama Music Family In 1990s Nigeria, two estranged sisters forced to live under the same roof while caring for their paralysed mother navigate grief, ambition, love, and the fragile bonds of family. Director Damilola Orimogunje Writer Damilola Orimogunje Stars Toyin Abraham Ajeyemi · Bimbo Akintola · Lanre Hassan · William Benson · Antar Laniyan + Add to Watchlist Rate & Review Recommend Overview Cast (12) Crew (16) Awards Reviews More Like This Movie Info Production credits, box office tracking & industry specifications Suggest an edit Report link STORYLINE & SYNOPSIS In 1990s Nigeria, two estranged sisters forced to live under the same roof while caring for their paralysed mother navigate grief, ambition, love, and the fragile bonds of family. Suggest an edit Report a broken / pirate link RATING 15 GENRE Faith· Drama· Music· Family· DIRECTOR Damilola Orimogunje PRODUCER Damilola Orimogunje , Ajah Enene-Orimogunje , Bose Oshin , Joshua Alabi , Zorana Musikic SCREENWRITER / WRITER Damilola Orimogunje RELEASE DATE (THEATERS / PREMI